# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Vulkan and SPIRV-Reflect structs are C structs whose documented initialization is zero-fill ({}), which leaves
# some enum members at 0 even when the enum has no 0 enumerator. That is the API's convention, not a bug.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: -bugprone-invalid-enum-default-initialization
